#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:3
#: 49d1ea1d5d85408484e57d18059400f0
msgid "有限晶胞合金占位（Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy）"
msgstr "Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:5
#: 694a2778858e43f88a7f262036cab80e
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr "**Category:** Alloys and Composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:7
#: b830ea2b55314219ba586bde54ec8c64
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:9
#: 09759522d10c4740970c096a1d50c8ac
msgid ""
"这张卡把合金比例落实为有限晶胞中真正可实现的整数原子数，再为每种整数组成生成不重复的占位排布。输入含 `atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]` "
"时，各子晶格分别约束；没有该数组时，全部位点属于名为 `all` 的单一位点集合。"
msgstr ""
"Convert alloy fractions into integer atom counts that are physically realizable in a "
"finite cell, then generate unique site arrangements for every integer composition. If"
" the input contains `atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]`, each sublattice is constrained "
"separately. Otherwise, all sites belong to one site set named `all`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:11
#: 07d6362e09324f1c8cb159378fc52aa8
msgid "组成模式有三种："
msgstr "Three composition modes are available:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:13
#: 10a815a756354d87a147dcbf19adedfc
msgid "`fixed_fraction`：指定固定目标比例；可整除时记为 `exact`，否则用最大余数法得到最近整数计划，并记为 `nearest_integer`。"
msgstr ""
"`fixed_fraction`: specify fixed target fractions. A target that maps exactly to "
"integer counts is marked `exact`; otherwise, the largest-remainder method produces "
"the nearest integer plan, marked `nearest_integer`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:14
#: 05b52c1fcfaa4f2daf10316b83306720
msgid "`fraction_range`：枚举实际整数占比落在各元素范围内的计划。"
msgstr ""
"`fraction_range`: enumerate plans whose realized integer fractions fall within the "
"specified range for every element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:15
#: 0e21a1996bad495c8cef78cb2d962b41
msgid "`count_range`：枚举各元素整数计数落在范围内、且总和等于位点数的计划。"
msgstr ""
"`count_range`: enumerate plans whose integer count for every element falls within its"
" range and whose total equals the number of sites."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:17
#: 62b95c1ff2dc4bc3af8f08d12e2f5aa0
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:19
#: cea55cfca361421b82c5eb0ea9f2ef60
msgid "有限晶胞不能实现任意连续比例。一个位点集合含 $N$ 个位点时，程序寻找满足"
msgstr ""
"A finite cell cannot realize arbitrary continuous fractions. For a site set "
"containing $N$ sites, the program searches for integer counts satisfying"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:21
#: 8ae1a04551504758a2465cc4ace62442
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"n_e\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0},\\qquad \\sum_e n_e=N\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:25
#: 76000da3486f4b1db28a19685049ec9c
msgid "的整数计数。无量纲占比范围 $f_e\\in[0,1]$ 会转换为"
msgstr "A dimensionless fraction range $f_e\\in[0,1]$ is converted to"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:27
#: da41d39038c04767b9f29649f0300ca2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\lceil f_{e,\\min}N\\rceil\\le n_e\\le\\lfloor f_{e,\\max}N\\rfloor.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\lceil f_{e,\\min}N\\rceil\\le n_e\\le\\lfloor f_{e,\\max}N\\rfloor.\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:31
#: 1a4bc6d014e94b71b377c3eb25ea5f04
msgid "给定一组计数后，该位点集合的不同排布总数为"
msgstr ""
"For a given set of counts, the total number of distinct arrangements on that site set"
" is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:33
#: 59607fe0f1c947c7a8137e27bfa7d2bd
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Omega=\\frac{N!}{\\prod_e n_e!}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:37
#: a1804c4c35e447b1bf54a577708cfc2b
msgid "多个子晶格的排布数是各自 $\\Omega$ 的乘积。设选中的整数组成集合为 $P$，每种组成请求 $A$ 个排布，总输出上限为 $M$，则实际输出数为"
msgstr ""
"For multiple sublattices, their arrangement counts multiply. Let $P$ be the selected "
"set of integer compositions, $A$ the requested arrangements per composition, and $M$ "
"the overall output limit. The actual output count is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:39
#: 7e310e682f554cbea195448f9f079fa1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_\\mathrm{out}=\\min\\left(M,\\sum_{i\\in P}\\min(A,\\Omega_i)\\right).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:43
#: c938db10596441cca968d1ccd1060efc
msgid "当预算不足时，卡片先覆盖不同组成，再轮流增加每种组成的第 2、第 3 个排布。它不会复制排布凑数，也不会把超出预算的结果称为已穷举。"
msgstr ""
"When the budget is insufficient, the card covers distinct compositions first, then "
"adds a second, third, and further arrangement to each composition in rounds. It "
"neither duplicates arrangements to fill the quota nor describes results beyond the "
"budget as exhaustively enumerated."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:45
#: bc9bfbe93d904e18ad3fe3b94ca01604
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:47
#: 30ecd1aed4914581b6ced717eaa9ff3b
msgid "小晶胞 HEA 的多个目标比例落到同一实际组成"
msgstr "Multiple Target Fractions Collapse to the Same Composition in a Small-Cell HEA"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:49
#: 45e6812a8767469aa6bfc9b50eb30d72
msgid ""
"32 位点随机固溶体若先采连续比例再取整，多个目标点可能变成同一整数计数组合。此时应直接使用“计数范围”枚举 Fe/Co/Ni 的可行计数，设置“每种组成的排布数”为 "
"4，并用“每个输入的最大输出数”控制规模。"
msgstr ""
"If continuous fractions are sampled and rounded for a 32-site random solid solution, "
"several target points may collapse to the same integer-count combination. Instead, "
"use `Count range` to enumerate feasible Fe/Co/Ni counts directly, set `Arrangements "
"per composition` to 4, and control the scale with `Maximum outputs per input`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:51
#: e8ca0d05f6914c34ac1f123a92a550a9
msgid ""
"输出中，相同实际计数组合具有相同的 composition ID；同一 composition 下的 arrangement ID 不重复。验证时应检查每帧 "
"`counts` 之和为 32、`(composition_id, arrangement_id)` 二元组唯一，并按 metadata 中的实际占比切片比较模型误差。"
msgstr ""
"Outputs with the same realized count combination share a composition ID, while "
"arrangement IDs are unique within a composition. During validation, check that "
"`counts` sum to 32 in every frame, that each `(composition_id, arrangement_id)` pair "
"is unique, and compare model errors in slices defined by the realized fractions "
"stored in metadata."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:53
#: fbb8fbad775e4631896f1da9b909f42e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:55
#: 2dd267dfd35d4643a2ccd1594a4d0707
msgid "位点划分规则（site_rules）"
msgstr "site_rules"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:57
#: 20cb16b4c0b54b32b2ff27bf65a11feb
msgid ""
"可视化编辑器用于选择“全部位点”或“按子晶格”，并为每个位点集合设置元素和组成模式。JSON 顶层 key 必须与输入的 `sublattice` "
"标签完全一致；无标签结构只使用 `all`。`group` 不会代替 `sublattice`。"
msgstr ""
"The visual editor selects either `All sites` or `By sublattice` and assigns elements "
"and a composition mode to each site set. Top-level JSON keys must exactly match the "
"input `sublattice` labels. An unlabeled structure uses only `all`; `group` does not "
"substitute for `sublattice`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:59
#: 764312b6647b4c1996fa6e70752a22af
msgid ""
"未手动编辑规则时，接入上游结构会按**首个输入结构**的标签、元素和当前占比自动匹配规则。默认模板中的 `X` 只是占位符，不能输出；手动编辑、选择模板、粘贴 JSON "
"或恢复持久化参数后，规则不再被自动覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"Before rules are edited manually, connecting an upstream structure automatically "
"matches rules to the labels, elements, and current fractions of the **first input "
"structure**. `X` in the default template is only a placeholder and cannot appear in "
"output. After manual editing, template selection, JSON pasting, or restoration of "
"persisted parameters, the rules are no longer overwritten automatically."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:61
#: f63ae61e1c8d4d20b5b811a9560fe069
msgid ""
"固定比例为无量纲数，范围是 $[0,1]$，且可视化编辑器要求同一位点集合内的比例和为 1。计数范围的单位是“个位点”，上下限必须是非负整数。旧 JSON 中 `1 + "
"1` 这类相对权重仍可由底层归一化，但新规则应直接填写 `0.5 + 0.5`。"
msgstr ""
"Fixed fractions are dimensionless values in $[0,1]$, and the visual editor requires "
"them to sum to 1 within each site set. Count ranges are measured in sites and require"
" nonnegative integer bounds. The backend can still normalize legacy JSON containing "
"relative weights such as `1 + 1`, but new rules should enter `0.5 + 0.5` directly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:63
#: 6fa2a42891794c37a559f309c3948e28
msgid "规则示例："
msgstr "Example rule:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:65
#: 443b9c379e4944658ea715d88bab60e5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\"A\":{\"elements\":[\"Fe\",\"Co\"],\"mode\":\"count_range\",\"counts\":{\"Fe\":[8,16],\"Co\":[8,16]}}}"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"{\"A\":{\"elements\":[\"Fe\",\"Co\"],\"mode\":\"count_range\",\"counts\":{\"Fe\":[8,16],\"Co\":[8,16]}}}"
"\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:69
#: fb104253f5b54358957d748c2f3105a9
msgid "“高级：查看或粘贴 JSON”可复制或载入旧规则；非法 JSON 不会覆盖当前有效规则。切换位点划分或应用模板会替换整组规则，已有手动编辑时界面会先确认。"
msgstr ""
"`Advanced: View or paste JSON` can copy or load legacy rules. Invalid JSON does not "
"overwrite the current valid rules. Changing the site partition or applying a template"
" replaces the entire rule set, and the interface asks for confirmation if manual "
"edits already exist."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:71
#: 7e166d26f86445b1b26bccafd74141fa
msgid "每种组成的排布数（arrangements_per_composition）"
msgstr "arrangements_per_composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:73
#: e83e7fb6105a4594a9265aa2100b300e
msgid "`int`，默认 1，单位为“个结构”。它表示每种实际整数组成请求多少个不同排布；若理论排布数 $\\Omega$ 更少，则只返回实际存在的数量。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 1, measured in structures. This is the requested number of distinct "
"arrangements for each realized integer composition. If the theoretical count "
"$\\Omega$ is smaller, only the arrangements that actually exist are returned."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:75
#: bf678dda325147f38a72d8a7e1e693f4
msgid "使用固定种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "use_seed"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:77
#: a9c053cab44141e6b198bee0f1fa08c5
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。开启后，组成预算抽样和具体位点排布均由固定 seed 派生。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default true. When enabled, both composition-budget sampling and concrete "
"site arrangements are derived from a fixed seed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:79
#: 9eb7ef28e49541fc8fe1cdefb999dc2f
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:81
#: fc75c09ddb324802b729ba99bdb875f6
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0，无单位，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。相同输入、规则和 seed 会得到相同结果。若所有可行组成都在预算内，改变 seed "
"不改变可行计数集合，只改变排布；若 `max_outputs` 截断了组成集合，seed 也会改变被选中的整数组成。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 0, dimensionless and used only when `use_seed=true`. The same input, "
"rules, and seed produce the same results. If every feasible composition fits within "
"the budget, changing the seed alters arrangements but not the feasible count set. If "
"`max_outputs` truncates the composition set, the seed also affects which integer "
"compositions are selected."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:83
#: 013b7b15b7e647c9a66b42292f6e43b9
msgid "每个输入的最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "Maximum Outputs per Input (max_outputs)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:85
#: d6dd32deef5148d686155abcf46735e8
msgid "`int`，默认 200，单位为“个结构”。它限制每个输入结构返回的总结构数，并采用“先覆盖组成、再增加排布”的分配顺序。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 200, measured in structures. It limits the total structures returned "
"for each input and allocates them in the order `cover compositions first, then add "
"arrangements`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:87
#: 5057fd70db314da1ab3a31bba0213d49
msgid "输出预览与失败条件"
msgstr "Output Preview and Failure Conditions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:89
#: 718b979972434e3e8c548e81e422aaa6
msgid ""
"UI 只用数据集的**首个输入结构**计算位点数、可行整数组成数和输出上界。若同一数据集中的结构具有不同原子数、`sublattice` "
"标签或位点数，后续结构会按各自真实位点重新计算，输出数可能不同，也可能因规则不匹配而失败；这类数据最好分组处理。"
msgstr ""
"The UI uses only the **first input structure** in the dataset to calculate site "
"counts, feasible integer-composition counts, and the output upper bound. If "
"structures in the same dataset differ in atom count, `sublattice` labels, or site "
"counts, later structures are recalculated using their actual sites. Their output "
"counts may differ, or they may fail because the rules do not match. Such data are "
"best processed in separate groups."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:91
#: 9d86109e6dc549c79622556700915441
msgid ""
"以下情况会显式失败，不会返回伪成功的空结果：规则与位点集合不匹配、仍含 "
"`X`、比例或计数范围非法，以及没有可行整数解。对于排布空间很大的组成，程序采用有上限的去重随机尝试；若尝试耗尽而未达到本应存在的目标数量，也会显式报告已生成数量与请求数量。"
msgstr ""
"The following conditions fail explicitly instead of returning a falsely successful "
"empty result: rules that do not match site sets, remaining `X` placeholders, invalid "
"fraction or count ranges, and no feasible integer solution. For compositions with "
"very large arrangement spaces, the program makes a bounded number of deduplicated "
"random attempts. If attempts are exhausted before reaching a target count that should"
" exist, it explicitly reports both the generated and requested counts."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:93
#: eaa1190f5f7f4135bc0dfe79877ea8d3
msgid "推荐配置"
msgstr "Recommended Configuration"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:95
#: 82f778b2d6ff426dbeac06b7cd4d82b7
msgid "32 位点二元合金可从以下规则开始，再按训练集缺口收紧计数范围："
msgstr ""
"For a 32-site binary alloy, begin with the following rule and then narrow the count "
"ranges according to gaps in the training set:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:97
#: ebcc9befbe5a4e309c397e99289fbdb6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"FiniteCellAlloyOccupancyCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"site_rules\": "
"\"{\\\"A\\\":{\\\"elements\\\":[\\\"Fe\\\",\\\"Co\\\"],\\\"mode\\\":\\\"count_range\\\",\\\"counts\\\":{\\\"Fe\\\":[8,24],\\\"Co\\\":[8,24]}}}\","
"\n"
"    \"arrangements_per_composition\": 4,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 17,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 68\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"FiniteCellAlloyOccupancyCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"site_rules\": "
"\"{\\\"A\\\":{\\\"elements\\\":[\\\"Fe\\\",\\\"Co\\\"],\\\"mode\\\":\\\"count_range\\\",\\\"counts\\\":{\\\"Fe\\\":[8,24],\\\"Co\\\":[8,24]}}}\","
"\n"
"    \"arrangements_per_composition\": 4,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 17,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 68\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:110
#: 5eabb2c93b164f53a61fbc5c7382f02c
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:112
#: 700bb18d4e734d63947e7b3b2f22ac9b
msgid ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`：保留 L1₂、B2、L1₀ "
"等原型的子晶格划分，并在各子晶格内生成受约束的无序占位。"
msgstr ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`: preserve the sublattice "
"partition of prototypes such as L1₂, B2, and L1₀ while generating constrained "
"disordered occupancy within each sublattice."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:113
#: e72aa87531a847f3945841f9e52e9db8
msgid ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder → Super Cell → Finite-Cell Alloy "
"Occupancy`：先得到足够位点，再生成可实现的随机固溶体组成。"
msgstr ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder → Super Cell → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`: create enough"
" sites first, then generate realizable random-solid-solution compositions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:114
#: e1c4f754ca1b4db8999267df85ec2105
msgid "`Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy → Atomic Perturb → Lattice Strain`：先确定占位，再补充坐标和晶格扰动。"
msgstr ""
"`Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy → Atomic Perturb → Lattice Strain`: determine occupancy "
"first, then add coordinate and lattice perturbations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:116
#: 7bf9c0cc76a44a66ad22a5778c772c09
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:118
#: eac7f26ddf49444ebaa87067461ed0ca
msgid "**为什么输出少于请求值？** 某种组成的理论排布数可能不足，或总输出已达到 `max_outputs`；卡片不会复制结构凑数。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are there fewer outputs than requested?** A composition may have too few "
"theoretical arrangements, or the total output may have reached `max_outputs`. The "
"card does not duplicate structures to fill the quota."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:120
#: c50f5041db4441b48bd6c441bf2aca15
msgid "**为什么提示规则不匹配？** 顶层 key 必须逐一匹配输入的 `sublattice` 标签；无标签结构只能使用 `all`。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are the rules reported as mismatched?** Each top-level key must match an input "
"`sublattice` label exactly. An unlabeled structure can use only `all`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:122
#: be7c5ad4efa34f8bbfad12b982a8f84c
msgid "**为什么没有整数解？** 各元素下限之和可能大于位点数，或上限之和小于位点数；占比范围也会先换算为当前晶胞可实现的整数边界。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is there no integer solution?** The sum of element lower bounds may exceed the "
"number of sites, or the upper bounds may sum to less than the number of sites. "
"Fraction ranges are also converted first to integer bounds realizable in the current "
"cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:124
#: e8c2ddb8728e4501b25994870ca280c7
msgid "输出标签与可复现性"
msgstr "Output Labels and Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:126
#: b07def3bb79f41f4866e07ffe788cdba
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 追加 "
"`FiniteAlloy(comp=<composition_id>,arr=<arrangement_id>)`。`finite_cell_alloy` "
"metadata 保存实际 `counts`、`fractions`、请求规则、实现状态、composition ID、arrangement ID 和派生 seed。"
msgstr ""
"`FiniteAlloy(comp=<composition_id>,arr=<arrangement_id>)` is appended to "
"`Config_type`. The `finite_cell_alloy` metadata stores realized `counts` and "
"`fractions`, requested rules, realization status, composition ID, arrangement ID, and"
" derived seed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:128
#: 7c568fdc96b1417e85ec2efe64f523c6
msgid "固定 `use_seed=true` 和 `seed` 后结果可复现；关闭固定种子后不保证重复运行得到相同组成抽样或排布。"
msgstr ""
"Results are reproducible with fixed `use_seed=true` and `seed`. With fixed seeding "
"disabled, repeated runs are not guaranteed to produce the same composition sample or "
"arrangements."

